fficulty":3,"explanation":"Bracchium is the source of the anatomical adjective brachial, as in the brachial artery.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-733a-ad34-d8bb5900bf89","description":"Bracchium","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-7e9a-8f1d-97f10a7d4260","description":"Caput","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-767b-8257-14b10b135944","description":"Pedis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-773a-b9af-397e8369ebff","description":"Oculus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-7531-ac02-afa4cf6a5cd1","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44480fe2c4f5","question":"What is the troy system of weights used to measure?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The troy system is used to measure precious metals. A troy ounce is about 31.1 grams, compared with about 28.35 grams for the everyday avoirdupois ounce.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-72dc-a080-f1746dc36d27","description":"Precious metals","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-781b-bbf0-9cbf9943c005","description":"Radiation","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-755e-8868-91aa428463d0","description":"Grain harvests","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-72bb-a9d4-aa33f60d2836","description":"Liquid fuels","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-7ef8-8415-fb5b5c7978fd","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44480fe2c4f5","question":"In January 2018, which retail chain that kids love announced it would close about 180 stores?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Toys \"R\" Us announced the closures as part of a restructuring after filing for bankruptcy in 2017.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-79b0-94b6-def81cc3fab1","description":"Toys \"R\" Us","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-7035-acdf-df139a62509b","description":"Target","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-761d-8cba-0df3b5840c28","description":"Walmart","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-36cb-7bb7-8a2a-fa03aa3a0a60","description":"Amazon","corre